flowchart TB
  accTitle: Dependency-aware implementation order
  accDescr: The proposed engineering order first externalizes authoritative state and evidence, then implements typed recovery and bounded workspace admission, integrates the existing GraSP skill path, adds outcome-attributed adaptive memory and skill policies, integrates cross-stage uncertainty and resource governance, and finally evaluates the composition against simpler baselines.
  S1[1. Externalize intent, uncertainty, budgets, recovery state, evidence]
  S2[2. Implement typed failure and bounded workspace admission]
  S3[3. Integrate GraSP and verified recovery eligibility]
  S4[4. Add adaptive memory and skill policies with attribution]
  S5[5. Integrate B6 across authorization, interruption, and stopping]
  S6[6. Run staged and full compositional evaluation]
  S1 --> S2 --> S3 --> S4 --> S5 --> S6
  classDef foundation fill:#EAF4FB,stroke:#1A4A8A,color:#1C1C1E,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef learning fill:#EEF7EE,stroke:#27AE60,color:#1C1C1E,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef evaluate fill:#F4F4F4,stroke:#888888,color:#1C1C1E,stroke-width:1.2px
  class S1,S2,S3 foundation
  class S4,S5 learning
  class S6 evaluate
